  "body": "Near new, beautifully designed and built for easy modern living, this impressive four bedroom home delivers the space, style and low-maintenance lifestyle today’s buyers are looking for.\r\n\r\nSet across a well-planned 184m² (approximately) floor plan, there’s plenty of room for families to spread out, with four generous double bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms (both with underfloor heating) and a dedicated study nook. The master bedroom enjoys the added luxury of its own ensuite, while the fully tiled bathrooms bring a sleek, contemporary finish.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open plan kitchen, dining and living area creates an inviting space for everyday life and entertaining, complemented by quality Bosch appliances. Two heat pumps ensure year round comfort, while the single internal access carpeted garage adds convenience.\r\n\r\nOutside, the landscaped 242m² (more or less) section is designed for easy care, giving you more time to enjoy everything this growing community and its surrounds have to offer.\r\n\r\nAnd the location is just as appealing. Motorways, public transport, the bus station, retail outlets, medical centres and excellent schools are all within easy reach, while Orewa township and its beautiful beach are just over the hill, along with a vibrant selection of cafés, restaurants and coastal amenities.\r\n\r\nAn elevated and private Freehold title and no body corporate fees add further appeal.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a stylish first home, a smart investment or a low maintenance property for your next chapter, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nContact us today for further information or we look forward to seeing you at our open home.\r\n\r\nPlease note:  previous staging has been used in the property photos.",
